  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Two-Handed Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>While not made for beginners, angled frontgrips can give existing longarms superior natural stability and flexibility to veteran shooters.</em></p>\n<p>To utilize this attachment, the user must have either Skill Level 7 or higher in the weapon’s requisite Skill or Combat Awareness Rank 2 or higher, and wield the weapon in two hands. When firing the weapon, users meeting these requirements have the total penalty (if any) applied to their Attack Check from Armor Penalties, Critical Injuries, and/or Wound States reduced by 1, or by 2 if making an Aimed Shot (i.e., A non-Aimed Attack while suffering an Armor Penalty of -2 to REF while Seriously Wounded [-2 Penalty] make a total -4 Attack Penalty, which is reduced to -3). While attached, the weapon cannot accept Underbarrel attachments. Incompatible with the non-angled Foregrip.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The situational +1 is for when you have such a penalty (use +2 by hand on Aimed Shots).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Grips &amp; Controls).</em></p>"
